[{"id":"mysql-replica-backup","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"MySQL","tags":["备份恢复","复制"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/2ec898f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/2ec898f2/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 MySQL 副本不能当作备份？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>因为误删和错误更新可能立即复制到副本，副本无法提供独立的历史恢复点。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>可靠恢复需要独立备份与 binlog 等恢复证据。综合实验会验证错误传播到副本后，如何恢复到事故前的时间点。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]